WEBVTT

00:00:01.010 --> 00:00:02.560
Welcome back, Hana.

00:00:03.040 --> 00:00:06.430
The situation changed a great deal while you were away.

00:00:06.430 --> 00:00:09.400
Yes, the vice president caught me up on most of it.

00:00:09.680 --> 00:00:11.580
Then that will speed things along.

00:00:11.580 --> 00:00:16.740
This latest event has reminded me of the dangers the boys pose.

00:00:16.740 --> 00:00:20.620
Therefore, I would like to kick them all out of school.

00:00:20.620 --> 00:00:22.110
Huh? But...

00:00:22.110 --> 00:00:23.980
According to the Underground Student Council bylaws,

00:00:23.980 --> 00:00:26.370
a third escape will result in expulsion.

00:00:26.370 --> 00:00:27.090
Yes, of course.

00:00:27.090 --> 00:00:31.480
But not even they are dumb enough to try breaking out three times.

00:00:31.480 --> 00:00:33.590
Which means it must be
done some other way?

00:00:33.590 --> 00:00:37.180
We will have to make the school

00:00:37.180 --> 00:00:38.970
realize the sort of danger they pose.

00:00:39.420 --> 00:00:43.110
First, we'll have each of the boys create problems on their own.

00:00:43.110 --> 00:00:45.310
Once we do that, public opinion of them will plummet.

00:00:45.310 --> 00:00:46.520
Public opinion?

00:00:46.520 --> 00:00:50.300
You mean, once we turn all of the girls in the school against them,

00:00:50.300 --> 00:00:52.900
not even the chairman will be
able to defend them anymore?

00:00:53.390 --> 00:00:54.140
Yes.

00:00:54.690 --> 00:00:56.820
This will be our Dog Transferal Operation,

00:00:57.200 --> 00:00:58.980
Operation DTO.

00:01:01.270 --> 00:01:04.830
Once again, she has duplicated
the "O" in "DTO" and "Operation."

00:01:04.830 --> 00:01:07.130
Should I ask her to correct herself?

00:01:07.130 --> 00:01:08.840
No, on the other hand...

00:01:08.840 --> 00:01:12.550
Last time, she instantly acknowledged
her mistake, and corrected it on her own.

00:01:12.550 --> 00:01:16.090
She will surely correct herself before I can get a word in—

00:01:16.500 --> 00:01:17.050
Or not?!

00:01:17.050 --> 00:01:17.970
President...!

00:01:17.970 --> 00:01:21.810
President, the "O" in "DTO" and the word "Operation" are redundant.

00:01:22.160 --> 00:01:23.860
Nicely spotted, Hana.

00:01:23.860 --> 00:01:26.740
I was testing you to
see if your mind had dulled

00:01:26.740 --> 00:01:28.650
in your absence from the
Underground Student Council.

00:01:28.650 --> 00:01:30.410
I should have known, President!

00:01:30.410 --> 00:01:34.320
I would have never considered such a test,
and you thought it up and executed it effortlessly!

00:01:34.320 --> 00:01:38.770
Come to think of it, Kiyoshi was
cleaning the bathroom all alone.

00:01:38.770 --> 00:01:40.700
Do you think he's being
shunned by the others?

00:01:41.050 --> 00:01:42.850
I noticed it, as well.

00:01:42.850 --> 00:01:45.610
Apparently, a rift has formed among the prisoners.

00:01:45.610 --> 00:01:49.330
They appear to be ostracizing Kiyoshi, with Shingo as the ringleader.

00:01:49.330 --> 00:01:50.080
I see...

00:01:51.000 --> 00:01:53.430
This could work in our favor.

00:03:24.410 --> 00:03:26.160
Today's work detail is now finished.

00:03:26.160 --> 00:03:27.590
Back to the prison, all of you!

00:03:27.590 --> 00:03:28.060
Yes.

00:03:28.930 --> 00:03:31.030
Shingo, I need a word.

00:03:31.030 --> 00:03:32.050
Come with me.

00:03:32.610 --> 00:03:33.580
Yes.

00:03:34.270 --> 00:03:36.560
Did he do something?

00:03:37.450 --> 00:03:39.240
What will she do to him?

00:03:46.520 --> 00:03:47.580
How have things been lately?

00:03:47.580 --> 00:03:49.090
Huh? Well...

00:03:49.910 --> 00:03:52.960
What's happening to you must be tough, thanks to Kiyoshi, right?

00:03:52.960 --> 00:03:53.580
Yes.

00:03:56.170 --> 00:03:59.170
I had thought that you'd
been doing so well lately, too.

00:03:59.170 --> 00:04:01.370
If it weren't for Kiyoshi's dumb little stunt,

00:04:01.370 --> 00:04:02.840
you'd have been out in a few days,

00:04:02.840 --> 00:04:05.550
and could have eaten anything you wanted.

00:04:07.530 --> 00:04:08.350
Help yourself.

00:04:08.350 --> 00:04:10.730
Huh? Do you really mean it?

00:04:11.820 --> 00:04:12.480
They're good.

00:04:17.230 --> 00:04:18.980
Way to wolf them down.

00:04:18.980 --> 00:04:20.540
Incidentally, Shingo...

00:04:21.410 --> 00:04:23.570
there's something I'd like you to do for me

00:04:26.730 --> 00:04:27.990
Ah, that feels better.

00:04:28.460 --> 00:04:30.240
What are we having for supper, again?

00:04:30.240 --> 00:04:31.270
Chicken cutlets.

00:04:35.320 --> 00:04:37.380
It doesn't bother me.

00:04:37.800 --> 00:04:40.710
After all, Gakuto, you won't have a leg to stand on if you stay chummy with me.

00:04:41.920 --> 00:04:45.050
So I'm fine with the way things stand right now.

00:04:46.650 --> 00:04:49.140
Kiyoshi-dono, yours truly is—

00:04:54.300 --> 00:04:57.470
Hey, Shingo. What did
the vice president want?

00:04:57.470 --> 00:04:59.020
Nothing.

00:05:00.230 --> 00:05:02.240
Hmm? You've got something on your cheek.

00:05:03.550 --> 00:05:05.330
It's none of your business.

00:05:07.410 --> 00:05:09.210
By your leave...

00:05:14.330 --> 00:05:16.960
I'm so sorry! I'm so sorry, Kiyoshi-dono!

00:05:16.960 --> 00:05:20.050
Right now, yours truly is neither Zhuge Kongming, nor Guan Yu Yungcheng!

00:05:20.050 --> 00:05:23.200
He is the infamous
traitor, Lü Bu Fengxian!

00:05:27.030 --> 00:05:31.760
Ho... I wear a countenance
of defiance at this moment!

00:05:34.930 --> 00:05:37.100
Hey! What are you looking at?!

00:05:37.100 --> 00:05:39.010
Oh, er, that is...

00:05:39.810 --> 00:05:40.700
I'm sorry!

00:05:40.700 --> 00:05:41.470
Forgive me!

00:05:41.470 --> 00:05:42.780
Get to work, already!

00:05:43.520 --> 00:05:44.400
Ow...!

00:05:44.400 --> 00:05:47.530
Our oversights have become much
more onerous these past few days.

00:05:47.950 --> 00:05:49.700
I envy you guys.

00:05:49.700 --> 00:05:53.360
I hate how Shingo-kun and I haven't been getting punished at all lately.

00:05:53.360 --> 00:05:54.380
Don't be silly.

00:05:54.380 --> 00:05:56.580
I've been taking plenty of shots to the gut.

00:05:56.580 --> 00:05:59.320
You have? Lucky you.

00:05:59.320 --> 00:06:03.050
Aw, why am I the only one not
getting whipped and kicked around?

00:06:04.570 --> 00:06:07.040
Why, you...! Are you trying to kill my ants?!

00:06:07.040 --> 00:06:08.090
I'll murder you!

00:06:08.090 --> 00:06:10.180
I'm sorry! I didn't mean to!

00:06:10.180 --> 00:06:12.880
You think "I'm sorry" covers it?! You can pay with your life!

00:06:12.880 --> 00:06:13.810
Stop it!

00:06:13.810 --> 00:06:16.310
Stay your hand! You mustn't do this in here!

00:06:16.310 --> 00:06:18.390
Let me go, you deuce-dropping four-eyes!

00:06:18.390 --> 00:06:21.480
Yours truly isn't letting go,
even if he has to soil his pants!

00:06:21.480 --> 00:06:23.690
Take it easy! The vice president will come!

00:06:25.440 --> 00:06:26.150
Well?

00:06:26.150 --> 00:06:28.570
Did you bring me any information, like you promised?

00:06:28.810 --> 00:06:31.280
Well, let's see...

00:06:31.280 --> 00:06:33.080
Everyone seems to be a little more on edge.

00:06:33.080 --> 00:06:35.650
What kind of vague double-talk is that?

00:06:35.650 --> 00:06:39.750
I said I'd feed you something tasty if you brought me information on the others,

00:06:39.750 --> 00:06:42.000
but if that's all you've got,
you're not getting anything,

00:06:42.000 --> 00:06:44.270
and I'll start getting stricter with you, too.

00:06:44.270 --> 00:06:46.600
But it's only been three days, not much has—

00:06:46.600 --> 00:06:47.630
I see.

00:06:47.630 --> 00:06:49.110
Then get on out of here,

00:06:49.110 --> 00:06:51.510
without eating any of this
¥1500-per-100-gram meat.

00:06:51.840 --> 00:06:54.700
Um, what else...? Oh, I know!

00:06:54.700 --> 00:06:57.770
Joe's ant farm was knocked over, and he got positively livid.

00:06:57.770 --> 00:07:00.620
He was saying he would murder Andre. It was a real mess.

00:07:00.620 --> 00:07:01.190
Ho...

00:07:01.190 --> 00:07:03.560
You don't say. He likes his ants that much?

00:07:03.560 --> 00:07:04.370
Hot!

00:07:04.370 --> 00:07:05.410
Are you all right?

00:07:05.410 --> 00:07:07.610
It's dangerous to eat directly
from the pot dressed like that!

00:07:07.610 --> 00:07:08.440
I'm fine.

00:07:08.960 --> 00:07:10.290
All right, you can eat.

00:07:10.290 --> 00:07:10.990
You mean it?

00:07:10.990 --> 00:07:11.860
It's good.

00:07:12.370 --> 00:07:13.610
Thank you for the meal.

00:07:14.590 --> 00:07:17.830
A quick dunk is enough for <i>shabu-shabu</i>. <i></i> "<i>Shabu-shabu-shabu-shabu</i>" is too long—

00:07:17.830 --> 00:07:18.790
Hot!

00:07:20.630 --> 00:07:23.940
Thank you for making the slogans for the campus-wide postings.

00:07:23.940 --> 00:07:26.060
This is all part of the job.

00:07:26.060 --> 00:07:26.710
So then,

00:07:27.100 --> 00:07:28.880
how is the DTO coming along?

00:07:28.880 --> 00:07:33.220
Well, just as we planned, Shingo is quickly becoming our snitch.

00:07:33.220 --> 00:07:37.600
You're cracking down on them harder, so their stress is building up.

00:07:38.170 --> 00:07:42.070
On the other hand, it's harder on that fatty Andre to <i>not</i> get beaten on.

00:07:42.070 --> 00:07:45.200
Meanwhile, Joe is so
partial to his pet ants,

00:07:45.200 --> 00:07:47.480
it seems to be causing some trouble among the group.

00:07:47.480 --> 00:07:49.200
Is that right?

00:07:49.200 --> 00:07:51.500
The more their stress builds,

00:07:51.500 --> 00:07:53.990
the greater the chance that they will cause problems.

00:07:53.990 --> 00:07:56.740
Should I confiscate Joe's ant farm set?

00:07:56.740 --> 00:07:59.200
No. I have a better idea...

00:07:59.930 --> 00:08:00.790
in mind.

00:08:05.500 --> 00:08:07.900
Joe-kun, I'm sorry about yesterday,

00:08:07.900 --> 00:08:09.590
about ruining your ants' home like that.

00:08:10.190 --> 00:08:11.180
It's okay.

00:08:11.180 --> 00:08:12.840
It was wrong of me
to get so mad at you, too.

00:08:13.260 --> 00:08:14.550
Um, here...

00:08:14.550 --> 00:08:16.380
You can give it to the ants, if you like.

00:08:16.380 --> 00:08:18.840
I'm afraid curry is too much for them.

00:08:18.840 --> 00:08:21.430
Still, thanks. I appreciate the thought.

00:08:22.270 --> 00:08:24.100
That was delicious.

00:08:24.510 --> 00:08:27.130
Hey, guys, let's go play tag outside.

00:08:27.130 --> 00:08:27.820
Okay, sure!

00:08:29.490 --> 00:08:31.080
Who's going to be "it"?

00:08:32.220 --> 00:08:33.350
Let's go.

00:08:37.030 --> 00:08:37.750
Hey!

00:08:37.750 --> 00:08:39.170
Wait up!

00:08:39.170 --> 00:08:40.870
Wait up! Wait up!

00:08:42.860 --> 00:08:43.500
Joe!

00:08:43.500 --> 00:08:45.620
What are you doing? Hurry on over!

00:08:46.330 --> 00:08:48.880
Sorry, but I've settled on walking my ants on Wednesdays.

00:08:49.400 --> 00:08:50.450
I'll be there in a bit.

00:08:50.940 --> 00:08:54.840
I'm trying to act normally, but they just ignore me.

00:08:56.120 --> 00:08:58.300
There sure are a lot of crows today.

00:09:12.780 --> 00:09:15.060
Distract Joe for a little while.

00:09:15.060 --> 00:09:16.240
All right.

00:09:16.240 --> 00:09:17.550
But why?

00:09:17.550 --> 00:09:19.810
You just do as you're told.

00:09:23.440 --> 00:09:24.490
Good, good.

00:09:24.490 --> 00:09:26.870
Watanabe and Kiyotaka are getting along.

00:09:26.870 --> 00:09:29.560
Come on, you have to
let Egawa in there, too.

00:09:29.560 --> 00:09:31.090
Hey, Joe!

00:09:31.470 --> 00:09:33.140
Come over here for a minute!

00:09:33.140 --> 00:09:35.970
What for? I'm not done walking them yet.

00:09:35.970 --> 00:09:37.470
It'll just take a second.

00:09:41.910 --> 00:09:45.980
It's unusual for all three Underground Student
Council members to be in the yard around this time.

00:09:50.690 --> 00:09:54.360
Yeah, it's about this morning's math class.

00:09:54.360 --> 00:09:55.720
The formula for this function...

00:09:55.720 --> 00:09:57.970
Formula? What the hell?

00:09:57.970 --> 00:09:59.870
It's no use asking <i>me</i>.

00:09:59.870 --> 00:10:01.560
But Joe, I thought you were good at math.

00:10:01.560 --> 00:10:04.120
Better than you. But this isn't the place.

00:10:18.430 --> 00:10:20.060
I told you, not right—

00:10:20.060 --> 00:10:20.930
Joe-kun!

00:10:20.930 --> 00:10:21.790
Your ants!

00:10:21.790 --> 00:10:23.720
Your ants are being attacked by a crow!

00:10:24.800 --> 00:10:26.170
Stop that, you filthy crow!

00:10:26.170 --> 00:10:27.200
Freeze!

00:10:27.770 --> 00:10:29.150
What do you think you're doing?!

00:10:29.150 --> 00:10:31.150
Please stand aside!
That crow is attacking my ants!

00:10:31.150 --> 00:10:33.890
That crow belongs to the president!

00:10:33.890 --> 00:10:34.860
I won't let you touch it!

00:10:34.860 --> 00:10:36.500
Just stand aside, please!

00:10:36.500 --> 00:10:36.940
No!

00:10:37.340 --> 00:10:38.480
Move it!

00:10:39.280 --> 00:10:41.070
My ants!

00:10:44.610 --> 00:10:45.540
What's going on?

00:10:45.540 --> 00:10:46.400
Looks like trouble.

00:10:46.400 --> 00:10:47.750
Are they all right?

00:10:48.320 --> 00:10:50.500
My... ants...

00:10:50.500 --> 00:10:53.150
Watanabe... Kawakami...

00:10:53.150 --> 00:10:54.250
Horiuchi...

00:10:54.250 --> 00:10:55.130
My goodness.

00:10:55.130 --> 00:10:57.760
Laying hands on the Underground Student Council, what is the meaning of this?

00:10:58.760 --> 00:11:00.290
Are you all right, Vice President?

00:11:00.290 --> 00:11:01.590
Yes, more or less.

00:11:02.130 --> 00:11:05.470
To injure the vice president over
something as insignificant as some ants.

00:11:05.890 --> 00:11:07.680
You are quite the barbarian.

00:11:08.160 --> 00:11:10.460
First the breakout, and now violence?

00:11:11.030 --> 00:11:12.730
This is a serious problem.

00:11:12.730 --> 00:11:14.340
What happened?

00:11:14.340 --> 00:11:17.690
Looks like the Underground Student Council and the boys are arguing.

00:11:17.690 --> 00:11:20.400
I will hand down your punishment later.

00:11:20.400 --> 00:11:23.980
Vice President, place this boy in solitary for now.

00:11:23.980 --> 00:11:24.240
Yes.

00:11:24.240 --> 00:11:26.080
This is all because...

00:11:26.080 --> 00:11:28.040
of your fucking crow!

00:11:30.500 --> 00:11:32.750
Don't do it, Joe!

00:11:41.760 --> 00:11:43.700
President! Are you hurt?!

00:11:43.700 --> 00:11:44.510
I'm fine.

00:11:44.800 --> 00:11:46.210
Joe, you little—!

00:11:46.210 --> 00:11:47.640
Vice President, just a moment.

00:11:54.240 --> 00:11:55.190
Kiyoshi...

00:11:55.790 --> 00:11:58.150
I... I...

00:11:58.660 --> 00:12:00.280
I'm all right, Joe.

00:12:00.910 --> 00:12:02.590
It's nothing to worry about.

00:12:10.330 --> 00:12:11.580
Kiyoshi-dono!

00:12:12.390 --> 00:12:13.180
What's that?!

00:12:13.180 --> 00:12:14.080
How awful!

00:12:14.080 --> 00:12:15.460
It's all the way in!

00:12:15.460 --> 00:12:17.410
Joe! You had a weapon—?!

00:12:17.410 --> 00:12:18.650
No, he didn't!

00:12:18.650 --> 00:12:20.340
You misunderstand. This is not weapon.

00:12:20.340 --> 00:12:24.300
It's just a broken tree branch, I landed on it just now.

00:12:24.300 --> 00:12:28.530
It pricked me a little bit,
but it's not a big deal.

00:12:28.530 --> 00:12:30.190
I was simply careless.

00:12:30.190 --> 00:12:31.930
I apologize for all the fuss.

00:12:31.930 --> 00:12:33.280
What are you talking about?

00:12:33.280 --> 00:12:36.060
If it were just a small prick,
there wouldn't be so much blood!

00:12:37.080 --> 00:12:38.380
My hemorrhoids.

00:12:38.380 --> 00:12:39.900
Vice President, I'm sure you're aware...

00:12:39.900 --> 00:12:41.740
of how serious they are,
and how much they can bleed.

00:12:42.780 --> 00:12:44.120
Well, fine.

00:12:44.920 --> 00:12:47.150
Joe, in addition to knocking over the vice president,

00:12:47.150 --> 00:12:49.880
charged at me with the intent to do harm.

00:12:49.880 --> 00:12:51.830
That is a fact.

00:12:52.170 --> 00:12:55.830
Vice President, take this
barbarian to solitary at once.

00:12:55.830 --> 00:12:56.670
Yes.

00:12:56.670 --> 00:13:00.170
President, I will take Kiyoshi to the nurse's office.

00:13:00.170 --> 00:13:02.860
No! I'll have Gakuto take me!

00:13:02.860 --> 00:13:04.430
Or I could even go alone!

00:13:04.430 --> 00:13:07.050
We can't let a prisoner walk
around unaccompanied, can we?

00:13:07.050 --> 00:13:09.070
You're right. Please do so.

00:13:09.070 --> 00:13:10.030
Okay!

00:13:10.030 --> 00:13:11.520
Come on, let's get going.

00:13:11.520 --> 00:13:12.630
Yes.

00:13:12.630 --> 00:13:15.410
I've got an awfully bad feeling about this.

00:13:18.650 --> 00:13:22.780
Joe, I'll be reporting your
aggression to the teachers, too.

00:13:22.780 --> 00:13:26.610
This all started because of
your fucking crow, didn't it?

00:13:26.610 --> 00:13:30.930
It was because your crow killed my ants!

00:13:30.930 --> 00:13:33.080
I want my ants back, you ant-murderer!

00:13:33.080 --> 00:13:35.540
Killed? What a sordid thing to say.

00:13:35.540 --> 00:13:36.720
Right, Vice President?

00:13:36.720 --> 00:13:37.630
Yes.

00:13:37.630 --> 00:13:39.460
Hey, Andre! Have you gathered them?

00:13:39.460 --> 00:13:42.420
Joe-kun, your ants are safe.

00:13:43.510 --> 00:13:47.270
Watanabe! Kiyotaka! Egawa, too!

00:13:47.270 --> 00:13:49.850
You're all here! But how?

00:13:49.850 --> 00:13:51.260
She was anting.

00:13:51.260 --> 00:13:52.160
Anting?

00:13:52.160 --> 00:13:54.560
Anting, as in "bathing in ants."

00:13:54.560 --> 00:13:56.960
Crows rub ants across their bodies,

00:13:56.960 --> 00:13:59.190
coating themselves in the
ants' formic acid secretions,

00:13:59.190 --> 00:14:02.270
and use them as an insecticide.

00:14:02.270 --> 00:14:05.490
You love ants so much, and yet you didn't even know that?

00:14:05.870 --> 00:14:07.980
When my crows go anting,

00:14:07.980 --> 00:14:10.370
they're smart enough not to kill a single ant.

00:14:10.370 --> 00:14:11.620
And you're calling her an ant-murderer?

00:14:12.110 --> 00:14:13.690
That's the height of rudeness.

00:14:13.690 --> 00:14:15.200
You mean...

00:14:15.500 --> 00:14:20.360
You caused quite a bit of trouble over a tiny misunderstanding.

00:14:20.360 --> 00:14:22.040
Stay in here and reflect on your actions.

00:14:22.710 --> 00:14:25.130
My... misunderstanding...?

00:14:26.950 --> 00:14:28.230
The nurse isn't here.

00:14:28.230 --> 00:14:29.870
I'll go call for her.

00:14:29.870 --> 00:14:31.530
There's no need.

00:14:31.530 --> 00:14:34.390
We'll just disinfect you and apply
some ointment, and you'll be fine.

00:14:34.390 --> 00:14:35.220
Uh, but...

00:14:35.480 --> 00:14:37.990
I said there's no need!

00:14:37.990 --> 00:14:38.880
Okay...

00:14:38.880 --> 00:14:40.390
All alone with Hana-san, huh?

00:14:40.390 --> 00:14:42.470
There's no telling what she'll do to me.

00:14:42.470 --> 00:14:43.220
Here!

00:14:43.940 --> 00:14:46.410
Okay, you can do the rest yourself.

00:14:50.620 --> 00:14:51.240
Finished?

00:14:51.240 --> 00:14:52.770
Wah! Not yet! Not yet!

00:14:52.770 --> 00:14:54.620
Geez, hurry it up!

00:14:55.870 --> 00:14:59.900
Ah, on second thought, it's fine.
You'll be dropping your pants anyhow.

00:14:59.900 --> 00:15:00.330
Dropping...?

00:15:01.840 --> 00:15:03.790
It's time for you to pee.

00:15:06.570 --> 00:15:10.300
Every last thing you did to
me will be payed back now.

00:15:11.230 --> 00:15:13.850
First, you're going to pee,
right in front of me.

00:15:13.850 --> 00:15:16.480
Huh? You mean, right <i>here</i>?!

00:15:16.480 --> 00:15:19.130
That's right. That's why I brought this.

00:15:19.130 --> 00:15:20.250
No, I can't do that!

00:15:20.250 --> 00:15:21.190
Just do it!

00:15:21.190 --> 00:15:22.980
And do it fast, before the nurse gets back.

00:15:22.980 --> 00:15:25.260
And to commemorate it, I'll snap a picture.

00:15:25.260 --> 00:15:25.940
Huh?

00:15:25.940 --> 00:15:27.820
You look a little stiff.

00:15:27.820 --> 00:15:30.630
Come on, smile and flash the "peace" sign while you're peeing.

00:15:30.630 --> 00:15:32.700
I don't need that kind of commemoration!
Please don't do this!

00:15:32.700 --> 00:15:34.960
Just do it! Let's see it, right now!

00:15:34.960 --> 00:15:35.700
No! Please stop!

00:15:35.700 --> 00:15:37.700
I won't!

00:15:37.700 --> 00:15:39.060
Stop resisting!

00:15:39.060 --> 00:15:40.410
I will not!

00:15:40.410 --> 00:15:41.620
Come on! Let's see it!

00:15:41.620 --> 00:15:42.670
No, I won't do it!

00:15:45.540 --> 00:15:47.920
You're pretty resistant today.

00:15:48.660 --> 00:15:50.010
Okay, fine.

00:15:50.010 --> 00:15:51.430
Huh? You mean it?

00:15:51.430 --> 00:15:52.840
Turn around!

00:15:53.460 --> 00:15:54.800
Okay...

00:15:54.800 --> 00:15:57.120
We'll switch turns.
We're running out of time.

00:15:58.220 --> 00:16:00.560
I'm going to pee on you first.

00:16:01.760 --> 00:16:05.470
I'm going to give you a taste of
the humiliation that you gave me.

00:16:05.470 --> 00:16:07.520
Um, if you do that here,

00:16:07.520 --> 00:16:09.440
the sheets will get soaked.

00:16:09.440 --> 00:16:11.160
I don't give a damn.

00:16:11.160 --> 00:16:13.070
Now, lie on your stomach. Hurry!

00:16:14.870 --> 00:16:17.020
Is she seriously planning on going through with this?!

00:16:17.020 --> 00:16:19.410
Don't you dare look!

00:16:19.410 --> 00:16:20.680
If you do...

00:16:20.680 --> 00:16:21.910
I'll kill you!

00:16:25.380 --> 00:16:26.710
Excuse me!

00:16:28.530 --> 00:16:30.170
Huh? That's strange.

00:16:30.620 --> 00:16:33.180
Isn't Kiyoshi-kun in here?

00:16:33.710 --> 00:16:36.140
Oh, maybe he's lying on the bed.

00:16:36.140 --> 00:16:37.010
Not good!

00:16:37.010 --> 00:16:38.040
If she...

00:16:38.040 --> 00:16:39.600
..sees us like this!

00:16:45.660 --> 00:16:46.770
Excuse me...

00:16:47.150 --> 00:16:47.990
Excuse me.

00:16:51.500 --> 00:16:52.620
Is something the matter?

00:16:52.980 --> 00:16:54.100
It's nothing.

00:16:54.100 --> 00:16:55.460
Is something the matter with...

00:16:55.760 --> 00:16:56.420
you?

00:16:56.420 --> 00:17:00.070
Earlier, Joe, one of the prisoners, committed a violent act,

00:17:00.070 --> 00:17:01.000
so I'm reporting it.

00:17:01.000 --> 00:17:02.920
An act of violence, huh?

00:17:03.380 --> 00:17:07.090
Are you sure you're not blowing it a little bit out of...

00:17:07.090 --> 00:17:07.720
proportion?!

00:17:07.720 --> 00:17:09.160
It's no exaggeration!

00:17:09.160 --> 00:17:11.600
He knocked down the vice president, and I was—

00:17:16.060 --> 00:17:17.020
Aren't you...

00:17:17.780 --> 00:17:19.480
going to answer your phone?

00:17:23.120 --> 00:17:25.530
Huh? He's not here.

00:17:27.070 --> 00:17:28.990
Don't you dare make a sound.

00:17:28.990 --> 00:17:30.740
And don't you move even a millimeter, either.

00:17:31.890 --> 00:17:32.980
But...

00:17:33.680 --> 00:17:35.200
we're too close...

00:17:36.430 --> 00:17:37.220
Her breath...

00:17:37.660 --> 00:17:39.160
I can feel her breath...

00:17:39.160 --> 00:17:40.250
Also...

00:17:40.250 --> 00:17:42.480
We're so exposed!
We don't have pants on!

00:17:42.480 --> 00:17:44.590
At this range, this is really bad!
In all kinds of ways!

00:17:45.190 --> 00:17:47.050
Chiyo-chan, hurry up and get out of here!

00:17:48.760 --> 00:17:49.870
What is that?

00:17:49.870 --> 00:17:54.490
Sorry... I'm really sorry...

00:17:54.490 --> 00:17:56.850
Really... Really...

00:17:59.000 --> 00:18:00.430
And...

00:18:00.430 --> 00:18:02.500
it's getting bigger!

00:18:03.480 --> 00:18:08.950
I am so terribly sorry...!

00:18:09.320 --> 00:18:11.810
Maybe they already finished treating him.

00:18:12.480 --> 00:18:15.120
I guess he wasn't hurt that badly.

00:18:15.120 --> 00:18:16.910
Well, that's a good thing.

00:18:17.850 --> 00:18:19.180
I really am sorry!

00:18:19.180 --> 00:18:20.440
It wasn't on purpose!

00:18:20.440 --> 00:18:23.630
It's something that happens on its own, completely out of my control!

00:18:30.340 --> 00:18:32.550
Of course, when the
phone rings, you answer...

00:18:32.860 --> 00:18:33.640
it!

00:18:38.150 --> 00:18:39.140
What?

00:18:39.140 --> 00:18:39.350
Hmm?

00:18:40.140 --> 00:18:42.810
I told you, you don't have to
plant sponge gourds this year!

00:18:42.810 --> 00:18:45.300
And don't call me over something like...

00:18:45.300 --> 00:18:46.020
that!

00:18:46.460 --> 00:18:50.050
For heaven's sake, they're so
eager to plant sponge gourds—

00:18:50.050 --> 00:18:50.740
Ah!

00:18:51.310 --> 00:18:52.430
Don't get the wrong idea.

00:18:52.430 --> 00:18:54.120
That is just a mouse...

00:18:54.120 --> 00:18:54.730
pad!

00:18:54.730 --> 00:18:55.920
Oh, you don't say.

00:18:56.500 --> 00:18:58.480
It's none of my business.

00:18:58.480 --> 00:19:01.820
My wrist has been sore lately,
and this supports it just right.

00:19:01.820 --> 00:19:03.070
Excuse me.

00:19:03.920 --> 00:19:07.690
DTO, the Dog Transferal Operation—

00:19:07.690 --> 00:19:10.720
It appears we'll need to intensify our plans.

00:19:11.760 --> 00:19:13.140
What's going on?!

00:19:13.140 --> 00:19:16.530
You're so loud. Lower your voice.

00:19:16.530 --> 00:19:18.800
I distracted Joe, just like you told me to,

00:19:18.800 --> 00:19:20.800
but I had no idea things
would end up like that!

00:19:20.800 --> 00:19:23.710
It's almost like I set Joe up, isn't it?!

00:19:24.340 --> 00:19:26.280
Hmph, is <i>that</i> all?

00:19:26.280 --> 00:19:27.990
Is that all?

00:19:27.990 --> 00:19:31.150
If that's the kind of work you're going to make me do, then I...

00:19:31.150 --> 00:19:33.270
You... what?

00:19:33.270 --> 00:19:35.490
You won't do what I tell you to do?

00:19:35.950 --> 00:19:38.740
You don't seem to realize your position, do you?

00:19:39.450 --> 00:19:40.490
Eh?

00:19:40.490 --> 00:19:42.630
If you won't do as I say,

00:19:42.630 --> 00:19:45.900
I can inform the other prisoners about you.

00:19:45.900 --> 00:19:46.930
Well, that's...

00:19:46.930 --> 00:19:50.410
What will they think when they find out that just a single one of them

00:19:50.410 --> 00:19:52.510
has been eating such delicious food?

00:19:52.510 --> 00:19:53.460
Not to mention...

00:19:55.140 --> 00:19:57.850
when they learn you've been spying on them!

00:19:58.380 --> 00:20:00.930
As long as you do as
I say, I won't wrong you.

00:20:01.560 --> 00:20:04.570
Just keep doing what you've been doing.

00:20:04.570 --> 00:20:05.520
Yes.

00:20:08.480 --> 00:20:10.670
Get back to work, now!

00:20:10.670 --> 00:20:14.160
If you try something like you did yesterday again, you'll be expelled immediately.

00:20:14.160 --> 00:20:15.280
Joe-kun!

00:20:15.280 --> 00:20:16.570
Are you okay?

00:20:16.570 --> 00:20:18.220
You're so thin!

00:20:18.220 --> 00:20:21.140
They haven't been feeding you enough, have they?

00:20:21.140 --> 00:20:22.940
I've been eating three square meals.

00:20:23.830 --> 00:20:24.920
And all of my dessert, too.

00:20:24.920 --> 00:20:27.180
Joe looks surprisingly good.

00:20:27.180 --> 00:20:28.170
Hey!

00:20:28.170 --> 00:20:30.160
What are you spacing out for?

00:20:30.160 --> 00:20:31.300
Keep those hands moving.

00:20:31.300 --> 00:20:33.170
Oh, sorry.

00:20:33.490 --> 00:20:35.380
Whoa, she's glaring at me like crazy.

00:20:36.130 --> 00:20:38.800
It really must be because of what happened in the nurse's office.

00:20:38.800 --> 00:20:42.880
I remember everything up until when we got under the bed...

00:20:42.880 --> 00:20:46.730
I have a feeling that something
really nasty happened, but what?

00:20:47.150 --> 00:20:49.060
Okay, five-minute break!

00:20:53.260 --> 00:20:55.810
Kiyoshi, grab the kettle for me.

00:20:56.230 --> 00:20:56.860
Huh?

00:20:57.450 --> 00:20:58.950
Get it now.

00:21:00.090 --> 00:21:01.150
Eh, whatever.

00:21:01.150 --> 00:21:02.790
Get it yourself.

00:21:03.100 --> 00:21:05.290
What's with you all of a sudden, Joe?

00:21:05.290 --> 00:21:06.290
It's none of your business.

00:21:06.290 --> 00:21:09.490
How long are you gonna keep acting like a brat?

00:21:09.490 --> 00:21:10.130
You're so full of crap.

00:21:10.130 --> 00:21:11.130
Huh?!

00:21:17.840 --> 00:21:20.350
Break's over! Back to work!

00:21:22.170 --> 00:21:24.310
Hey, Shingo, come over here.

00:21:24.310 --> 00:21:26.560
I'm giving you a different job.

00:21:27.430 --> 00:21:29.020
Yes...

00:21:36.550 --> 00:21:37.950
Want some?

00:21:40.300 --> 00:21:41.300
Thanks.

00:21:43.250 --> 00:21:44.200
You saved me...

00:21:45.100 --> 00:21:46.200
back there.

00:21:46.590 --> 00:21:48.930
Kiyoshi, if you hadn't stopped me,

00:21:48.930 --> 00:21:50.710
I'd have been on my way to a real prison.

00:21:52.160 --> 00:21:52.960
Thanks.

00:21:54.920 --> 00:21:58.250
Nah, my body just moved on its own,

00:21:58.250 --> 00:21:59.800
like "Yikes, I gotta stop him!"

00:22:00.860 --> 00:22:04.430
Don't go trying to play the hero after getting a stick jammed up your ass.

00:22:04.430 --> 00:22:07.570
Joe, you're the one who
jammed it up there, you know?

00:22:07.570 --> 00:22:09.250
Sorry, you're right.

00:22:11.150 --> 00:22:14.470
You know, if I had more
knowledge about ants,

00:22:14.470 --> 00:22:16.690
none of that would have happened.

00:22:16.690 --> 00:22:17.860
I don't know about that...

00:22:18.980 --> 00:22:21.850
I mean... how can I put it...?

00:22:22.620 --> 00:22:26.440
There was something weird
about that whole lunch break.

00:22:27.180 --> 00:22:29.850
The entire Underground Student Council was in the yard,

00:22:29.850 --> 00:22:31.710
but they never hang out there.

00:22:31.710 --> 00:22:33.100
Moreover...

00:22:33.100 --> 00:22:33.840
Moreover?

00:22:36.090 --> 00:22:38.820
I couldn't make them out all that clearly,

00:22:38.820 --> 00:22:41.130
but I more or less caught enough of it.

00:22:41.880 --> 00:22:44.550
This is... my uniform...

00:22:44.550 --> 00:22:47.630
I'm giving you permission to leave campus for the next two hours.

00:22:47.630 --> 00:22:48.410
Huh?

00:22:48.830 --> 00:22:52.670
I'm saying, put on that uniform, go outside, and relax.

00:22:52.670 --> 00:22:53.650
Are you serious?

00:22:54.300 --> 00:22:58.140
Like I said, I won't wrong you.
